            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's new in ShawNotch 1.7.5</h2>
<ul>
<li>Music Mode now colours your icons and widgets whatever your icon style. macOS only shows the colour in the Tinted style, so Music Mode switches to Tinted while it's on, and puts your own style back when you switch it off or quit.</li>
</ul>
